# shell: tracker
# NeXT UIG ch3: when the APPLICATION moves the selection, it keeps it in
# view -- a rename that re-sorts the row past the viewport follows it.
wait 8
expect-scroll 0
click-row 1
wait 2
key e ctrl
wait 3
key z
key z
key z
key Return
wait 8
expect-selected-name zzz
expect-scroll 24
note the user's own scrolling is never chased back
press 747 105
wait 2
release 747 105
wait 3
quit
